kodex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `kodex fork`, `kodex exec`, and `kodex exec fork`
kodex fork --worktree: `kodex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
kodex fork --worktree --last: `kodex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
kodex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `kodex exec fork --worktree`
kodex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
kodex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `kodex fork`, `kodex exec`, and `kodex exec fork`
kodex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `kodex fork`, `kodex exec`, and `kodex exec fork`
kodex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `kodex fork`, `kodex exec`, and `kodex exec fork`
